  itemDatabase:
  - itemName: document.txt
    isSafe: 1
    explanation: Text documents are safe to open. They don't contain executable code.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 117477cb88ef99e4c9db1f318de6ad76, type: 3}
  - itemName: image.jpg
    isSafe: 1
    explanation: Image files are generally safe. Just standard picture files.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 86350e07522340849864b8e241ad646a, type: 3}
  - itemName: readme.txt
    isSafe: 1
    explanation: Text files are safe. No risk of malware.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dc1029879efb70141ab6fc5317c46a6a, type: 3}
  - itemName: vacation_photo.png
    isSafe: 1
    explanation: Photos from your camera are safe to view.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e16a585b9aeccc5458ed873950bb5c76, type: 3}
  - itemName: spreadsheet.xlsx
    isSafe: 1
    explanation: Office documents from trusted sources are safe.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2cfaee99674e9fd478561aec8d4a184e, type: 3}
  - itemName: virus.exe
    isSafe: 0
    explanation: Executable files (.exe) from unknown sources are DANGEROUS. They
      can execute malware.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e2272b1f597395498002176246b9060, type: 3}
  - itemName: malware.bat
    isSafe: 0
    explanation: Batch files can execute harmful system commands. DELETE immediately.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: afa6a0a324705e34a99afd115305163a, type: 3}
  - itemName: trojan.scr
    isSafe: 0
    explanation: Screen savers from untrusted sources often hide trojans. SCAN or
      DELETE.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 91b34a5ce50fbc142b60c2dbca99ec8e, type: 3}
  - itemName: ransomware.zip
    isSafe: 0
    explanation: Archive files from unknown senders could contain encrypted payloads.
      SCAN first.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 636ddd38ce7a3d547a2c1fed2409b78e, type: 3}
  - itemName: installer.exe
    isSafe: 0
    explanation: Installers from unknown sources could install unwanted software.
      Be cautious.
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fe31d7d4f865294c9de81a68d7c1e73, type: 3}
